th, hits, eliminations, and round wins on the scoreboard. The first team to five round wins takes the match.\n\nOptional Windows downloads for LAN matches:\n\nPaintBall Server \u2014 host matches on a Windows PC:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1PpMscxVv0bLRc7QxGjS5u5NB1p1c_cSh/view?usp=drive_link\n\nPaintBall Spectator \u2014 watch matches, switch player views, and follow the map and scores on a Windows PC:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1HkGH1TJnd7y72N8RK_gV9j1NNkRVekY8/view?usp=drive_link", "short_description": "Choose your robot and team, then bring colorful VR paintball battles to the arena."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.dodsgame.com/gizlilik-politikasi", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DODs Game", "support_website_url": "https://www.dodsgame.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.dodsgame.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "tr"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28437699529262342"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596061819_1649853976497250_1392865022912310056_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CCHiYxGUrJ4Q7kNvwGuwScS&_nc_oc=Adrt7VFhLTrYm7xWVy95Lelsv124zKPFW1tJrxgNeJBSIZV6q-57I3YRfA4RKJlGsEo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscd